  "solution": {
    "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Alkyl halide undergoes&nbsp;nucleophilic substitution reaction. More nucleophilic nitrogen of amine group, more reactive will it be with alkyl halides.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Presence of electron-withdrawing group will decrease the nucleophilic character of amino group.</p><p>Hence the order of reactivity;</p><p><img height=\"160\" src=\"assets\\st0172_125695d4f2b3.png\" width=\"375\" /></p><p><img height=\"202\" src=\"assets\\st0172_11c49b0d3f1e.png\" width=\"447\" /></p>"
